# Density Compare
# Antimony (Sb) — real density 6.697 g/cm³. equal masses: Antimony vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Antimony Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 10.6mm color: #9e63b5 at (-20mm, 5.3mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 53.4 g — the water cube is the reference
